math-academy-id "q-130890" :question/problem "If $\\,\\text{Re}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ b\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\text{Im}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}c \\\\ d\\end{aligned}]\\,$ are the real and imaginary parts of the vector $\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}1-3\\text{i} \\\\ -1-5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$ then what is the value of $ac+bd?$" :question/worked-solution "For the given vector $\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}1-3\\text{i} \\\\ -1-5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =[\\begin{aligned}1-3\\text{i} \\\\ -1-5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(x)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(x)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore $\\,a=1,b=-1,c=-3$ and $d=-5$, which implies that \n\n$$\nac+bd=1\\cdot (-3)+(-1)\\cdot (-5)=2.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130890/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "689f9f44-4776-56a7-915f-d0dab0755002"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130890"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-76048/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "3f5ce59f-dd82-52e3-a969-551c95cffba4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76048/selection/c387750f4e875670fe4a9d1ac9874f4397c1e24f1f9a0f3a006c51e5a7715777" :answer/id #uuid "3d87b205-1fc0-59ab-9c2f-49e4635e4af8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-43" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76048/selection/e645b0f714e0f14adf4a4392c1fd41e203b4d4c946a42f546b48043b8700d60e" :answer/id #uuid "18b98275-da3c-5f62-8827-02b9ef6778f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "31" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76048/selection/abe476e447976564bc5c670fe73789666287b967d49bbed12b1d85144449e63e" :answer/id #uuid "9a596594-1797-5c88-bee2-7e43c1f291f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :